# =============================================================================
# RB4011 — Pi dual-home + mgmt reservation DELTA (R-2 / HD-304)
# Rendered from SSOT. IDEMPOTENT: every /add guarded with :if-find — safe to
# re-import (no duplicate-abort). Apply: /import rb4011_pi_delta.rsc
# =============================================================================

# --- 1. ether10 dual-home: untagged Home (10) + tagged Mgmt (99) ---
# Set the bridge port pvid to 10 (untagged Home); vlan99 arrives TAGGED on the
# dual-homed port (port model 2026-09-01: untagged=primary, tagged=secondary).
/interface bridge port set [find where interface=ether10] pvid=10 comment="Raspberry Pi (Dual: Home10 + MGMT99)"

# --- 2. vlan-10 untagged member on ether10 (Home access) ---
# Only touch STATIC vlan-10 entries (dynamic ones can't be set — live 2026-09-01:
# 'can not change dynamic' on an auto-created vlan10). Add a static vlan-10 only
# if no STATIC entry exists; else set the static one. untagged=ether10 keeps Home
# reachable to family clients (Kogler SSID = untagged Home); Mgmt rides TAGGED 99.
:if ([/interface bridge vlan find where vlan-ids=10 and dynamic=no] = "") do={
    /interface bridge vlan add bridge=bridge-lan vlan-ids=10 tagged=bridge-lan,sfp-sfpplus1 untagged=ether10 comment="Home VLAN access (Pi)"
} else={
    /interface bridge vlan set [find where vlan-ids=10 and dynamic=no] tagged=bridge-lan,sfp-sfpplus1 untagged=ether10 comment="Home VLAN access (Pi)"
}

# --- 2b. vlan-99 TAGGED member on ether10 (admin/Mgmt plane) + untagged for Mgmt-only ports ---
# ether10 carries Mgmt TAGGED (port model); ether2 too. ether7/9 (iLO, HMIP) are
# Mgmt-only access → UNTAGGED. Idempotent guarded add/set like VLAN 10 above.
:if ([/interface bridge vlan find where vlan-ids=99 and dynamic=no] = "") do={
    /interface bridge vlan add bridge=bridge-lan vlan-ids=99 tagged=bridge-lan,sfp-sfpplus1,ether2,ether10 untagged=ether7,ether9 comment="Management VLAN (tagged admin + untagged mgmt access)"
} else={
    /interface bridge vlan set [find where vlan-ids=99 and dynamic=no] tagged=bridge-lan,sfp-sfpplus1,ether2,ether10 untagged=ether7,ether9 comment="Management VLAN (tagged admin + untagged mgmt access)"
}

# --- 3. Pi mgmt-99 static reservation (10.10.99.20 on dhcp-mgmt) ---
# Add a STATIC reservation if none exists for this MAC on dhcp-mgmt.
# (A dynamic lease already exists for .97 — never `set` it; static reservation
#  takes precedence, live lesson 2026-09-01: 'can not change dynamic lease'.)
:if ([/ip dhcp-server lease find where mac-address=E4:5F:01:26:EF:AA and server=dhcp-mgmt and dynamic=no] = "") do={
    /ip dhcp-server lease add server=dhcp-mgmt address=10.10.99.20 mac-address=E4:5F:01:26:EF:AA comment="pi mgmt reservation"
}

# --- 4. Pi VLAN-10 static reservation (10.10.1.20 on dhcp-10, already present — ensure) ---
:if ([/ip dhcp-server lease find where mac-address=E4:5F:01:26:EF:AA and server=dhcp-10 and dynamic=no] = "") do={
    /ip dhcp-server lease add server=dhcp-10 address=10.10.1.20 mac-address=E4:5F:01:26:EF:AA comment="pi static reservation (R-2)"
}

:log warning "rb4011_pi_delta.rsc applied"
